# Meet 'N Go — build-time configuration for the Codemagic APK build.
#
# Both apps read these with String.fromEnvironment, so they are compiled into
# the APK rather than fetched at runtime. Codemagic can supply them as
# environment variables instead, and codemagic.yaml prefers that when they are
# present; this file is the fallback so a rebuild needs no dashboard steps and
# nobody has to type a 195-character key on a phone keyboard.
#
# The value below is the project's **anon** key. It is a public client
# credential and is designed to ship inside a mobile app: every read it
# authorises is already filtered by the row level security policies in
# supabase/migrations/20260927000001_init.sql, and it can only ever see rows
# those policies permit. Publishing it in this file exposes exactly what
# shipping it in the APK already exposes.
#
# The project's **service_role** key bypasses row level security entirely. It
# must never appear in this file, in the repository, or in any build. The check
# in codemagic.yaml exists to fail the build if one is ever added by mistake.

SB_URL=https://mkdbzddgafkqnejivikt.supabase.co
SB_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6Im1rZGJ6ZGRnYWZrcW5laml2aWt0Iiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1ODc4MjcsImV4cCI6MjEwNjE2MzgyN30.Z804ObAHIBg_N8lPXWKPINlybTtJNB-HG3XWn7WOkkQ
